Hello there. I'm using version 1.5.9.RELEASE of spring boot. Accordingly to the [documentation
](https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/docs/current/reference/html/common-application-properties.html) the setting `spring.jpa.hibernate.naming.implicit-strategy` should work properly however I found that my custom implicit naming strategy is not worked under given setting within application start (i have both `spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update` `spring.jpa.generate-ddl=true` to check this). 

However while debugging hibernate sources i found that property `spring.jpa.properties.hibernate.implicit_naming_strategy` is more appropriate and it works for me. Please, either adjust your parameter to a given one or change documentation.

