…riginal Admidio login routine need to be patched.

This patch splits the authentification logic from any browser based response
messages, so that the Klobs client can be authentificated even without
browser interaction.

The normal web based behaviour stays unchanged.

For that, the todays login_check.php is kept as one part still containing
the browser login response messages, and a new file, login_func.php, which
now contains the pure authentification.

So existing applications can still call login_check without any differences,
while non-browser application use login_func.php instead and call

$checkLoginReturn =createUserObjectFromPost();
if (is_string($checkLoginReturn))
    {
        $gMessage->show($checkLoginReturn);
        // => EXIT
    }
    else
    {..}

to login without any browser interaction.

