I'm using an nginx instance in conjunction with mpd to serve high quality (1500x1500) album covers in my lan. Previously I used  [mpdroid](https://github.com/abarisain/dmix) that has this function built-in and I was hoping this could be something worth implementing.

```
$ cat mpd-covers.conf

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name 10.0.0.110;

    location / {
        root /media/music;
        rewrite /(.*) /$1 break;
        try_files $uri $uri /.no-cover-art.jpg;
        allow   10.0.0.0/24;
        deny    all;
    }
}
```

##  a N:M assocation

Assuming there are a `User` Model and a `Role`  Model :

```js
const User=sequelize.define(
    'user',
    { username:Sequelize.STRING, },
    { tableName:'user' }
);

const Role=sequelize.define(
    'role',
    { name: Sequelize.STRING, },
    { tableName:'role', }
);
```
The `Role` and `Model`  Model have a N:M assocation through `UserRole` :
```js
const UserRole = sequelize.define(
    'userRole', 
    {
        userId: {
            type: Sequelize.INTEGER,
            field: 'user_id',
            references: { model: User, key: 'id', },
        },
        roleId: {
            type: Sequelize.INTEGER,
            field: 'role_id',
            allowNull: false,   // here's where the AggregateError occours
            references: { model: Role, key: 'id', },
        },
        description: Sequelize.STRING,
    },
    {
        tableName: 'user_role',
        timestamps:false,
    }
);

User.belongsToMany(Role, { through: UserRole ,foreignKey:'user_id',otherKey:'role_id'});
Role.belongsToMany(User, { through: UserRole ,foreignKey:'role_id',otherKey:'user_id'});
```
Notice that we define a  `allowNull:false` property for the foreign key of `roleId` in the code above.

then execute a `User#addRoles()` query:
```js
User.create({username:'user_name'})
.then(user=>{
    return Role.create({ name: `role_name`})
        .then(function (role) {
            return user.addRoles([role],{ through:{ description:'shit', }, });
        });
});
```

## AggregateError Occours

if we add a `allowNull: false` to the `roleId` property of `UserRole` as above, the User#addRoles() query will throw a AggregateError Exception :
```
